  "description": "The K-Feather, powered by DELTECH, is one of the lightest and most compact folding e-bikes at just 12kg. Its sleek 16\" frame and clean design fit seamlessly into any setting. With an internal battery hidden in the frame, it offers up to 40km of e-assisted range, making it ideal for commuting or recreation.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nFeaturing DELTECH and Super DownTube—key patents of DAHON-V technology—it offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nCustomize Your Comfort\n\nEasily adjust the handlebar height and angle to match your perfect riding position. The flexible design adapts to any style, making every ride a personalized experience.\n\nThe battery is cleverly concealed within the main tube, blending seamlessly into the frame for a sleek look and enhanced protection.\n\nHigh-End Performance, Every Ride\n\nEquipped with top-tier components for reliability, power, and precision, delivering an exceptional riding experience from start to finish.\n\n24V 250W High-Speed Rotor Motor\n\nCompact and efficient motor for a smooth ride with strong climbing power.\n\nWeighing just 12 kg and featuring a 16-inch frame, the DAHON ultra-light electric-assist bike redefines simplicity with its DAHON-V Speed Technology.\n\nThe incorporation of the DELTECH cable transforms the bike frame into a robust triangular structure, enhancing the frame rigidity substantially",
